OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis Saturday marks the 50th
OL,7,Fanniversary of the introduction of one
OL,8,Fof the BBC's most iconic images.
OL,10,FA modified version of BBC1's globe
OL,11,Fident was introduced on Saturday 28th
OL,12,FDecember 1974.
OL,14,FThe corporate 'BBC 1 COLOUR' ident was
OL,15,Freplaced by a large 'BBC 1' logo in the
OL,16,FFutura font.
OL,18,FThe colour scheme changed dramatically
OL,19,Ftoo ` from pale blue and black to bold
OL,20,Forange, blue and white.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt should be remembered though that
OL,7,Fmost viewers were still watching in
OL,8,Fblack and white in 1974, so for them,
OL,9,Fthe only obvious change would be to the
OL,10,Flogo.
OL,12,FThis was the second of three main
OL,13,Fversions of the mirror globe but for my
OL,14,Fmoney this is the definitive one.
OL,16,FThe decision to drop the corporate logo
OL,17,Fseems surprising in retrospect but the
OL,18,Fcolour scheme is a huge improvement,
OL,19,Ftaking advantage of improved equipment.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13503
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt should be noted that there were
OL,7,Ffurther changes in 1976. A new model
OL,8,Fwas created, as can clearly be seen
OL,9,Ffrom the geography of the globe. The
OL,10,Fshape and positioning of Greenland is
OL,11,Fquite a giveaway.
OL,13,FIt is interesting to note too that BBC
OL,14,Fdocumentation from early 1974 ` now
OL,15,Favailable online ` reveals that thought
OL,16,Fwas given to changing the symbol
OL,17,Fradically. However this idea was later
OL,18,Fabandoned.
OL,20,FIt's rather ironic though that this
OL,21,F"brand refresh" coincided with painful
OL,22,Fcuts to TV output.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13504
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1974 inflation was running high in
OL,7,Fthe wake of the oil crisis a few months
OL,8,Fearlier.
OL,10,FThe BBC was campaigning for a
OL,11,Fsignificant rise in the TV Licence and
OL,12,Fconcerned about its deficit.
OL,14,FIn December 1974 major cuts to TV and
OL,15,Fradio output were announced, which were
OL,16,Fto take effect after the holiday
OL,17,Fseason.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13505
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn BBC One, the fledgling afternoon
OL,7,Fservice ` filling the time available
OL,8,Fbetween afternoon schools programmes
OL,9,Fand children's programmes ` was
OL,10,Fabandoned.
OL,12,FThe afternoon service was run on a
OL,13,Fshoestring and could not properly
OL,14,Fcompete with ITV's full afternoon
OL,15,Foffering, aimed principally at
OL,16,Fhousewives.
OL,18,FBut this was still the first time the
OL,19,FBBC had actively cut back or abandoned
OL,20,Fa service in peacetime in this way.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13506
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother nasty cut happened at the same
OL,7,Ftime. Evening closedowns on weekdays on
OL,8,FBBC One were brought forward to
OL,9,F11.30pm, although thankfully this rule
OL,10,Fwas relaxed a few months later once
OL,11,Fsome increase in the licence fee was
OL,12,Fagreed.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13507
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,F(BBC Two's hours were also cut in
OL,7,FJanuary 1975 and daytime transmitter
OL,8,Fshutdowns were introduced as a further
OL,9,Feconomy measure. Various economies were
OL,10,Falso made to BBC Radio. However
OL,11,Fabandoning afternoon TV on the
OL,12,Fcorporation's flagship service was the
OL,13,Fmost immediately obvious effect of the
OL,14,Fcorporation's cash crisis, even though
OL,15,Fit was a new initiative and the test
OL,16,Fcard had never completely disappeared
OL,17,Ffrom the weekday afternoon schedule.)
OL,19,FStill it is ironic that the
OL,20,Fintroduction of this iconic version of
OL,21,Fthe globe coincided with cuts to the
OL,22,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13508
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn those days, idents were meant to
OL,7,Flast. Careful consideration was given
OL,8,Fto changes as the expectation was that
OL,9,Fthe new look would last for several
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FIt is worth noting that the corporate
OL,13,F"BBC 1" logo did not vanish with the
OL,14,Frevamp, which perhaps makes the
OL,15,Fdecision to remove it from the ident
OL,16,Fmore intriguing.
OL,18,FThe corporate logo stayed on programme
OL,19,Fslides and some trails for several
OL,20,Fmonths afterwards.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13509
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndeed it only disappeared from generic
OL,7,Fnetwork programme menus around about
OL,8,Fthe same time as the next refresh of
OL,9,Fthe mirror globe in 1981.
OL,11,FSo why is this particular version of
OL,12,Fthe globe just so special?
OL,14,FFor my money, the colour scheme is
OL,15,Fperfect and it emits an unashamed
OL,16,Fconfidence ` despite the serious
OL,17,Fproblems facing the BBC at the time.
OL,19,FIt should also be remembered that many
OL,20,Ffamilies got their first colour TV
OL,21,Fbetween 1974 and 1981.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13510
SC,0010
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F135A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe popularity of colour TVs only
OL,7,Fstarted to take off around 1973, helped
OL,8,Fby the wedding of Princess Anne. Before
OL,9,Fthen, they had been much more expensive
OL,10,Fin real terms.
OL,12,FThe number of colour licences first
OL,13,Fexceeded the number of black and white
OL,14,Flicences in 1976.
OL,16,FBy 1981, few had a black and white set
OL,17,Fin the living room unless they watched
OL,18,Flittle TV or would have struggled with
OL,19,Fthe cost.
OL,23,APub: 22-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,136,120,200,300,0,100
